Name Rio Flight 2283 Memorial

Interactability_Text_Line_0 On August 9th, 2024, Voepass flight 2283 crashed in a neighborhood in Vinhedo, São Paulo, unfortunately claiming 62 lives.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 It was the first fatal plane accident in Brazil since 2007, when TAM flight 3054 overran the Congonhas Airport runway and crashed in a nearby building, claiming 199 lives. 
Interactability_Text_Line_2 It's not much, but we wanted to express our condolences to the families and friends of the passengers and crew members with a memorial in our map. We hope that aviation keeps getting safer and these accidents don't happen again.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 - The Rio Team